{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"file\": {\n    \"id\": \"01M3M9A2DA2G08DSJA5K8ZE68S\",\n    \"name\": \"Enthusiastic lantern\"\n  },\n  \"contentHash\": {\n    \"tokens\": \"8e14c182\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"(\n    <div style={{ backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontSize: '12px', fontSynthesis: 'none', gap: '48px', height: 'fit-content', lineHeight: '16px', MozOsxFontSmoothing: 'grayscale', overflow: 'clip', overflowWrap: 'anywhere', padding: '64px', WebkitFontSmoothing: 'antialiased', width: '1440px' }}>\n      <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '10px', maxWidth: '760px' }}>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-k26-action)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-k26-ui)', fontSize: '12px', fontWeight: 600, letterSpacing: '0.06em', lineHeight: '16px' }}>\n          K-05 KOMPONENTER\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-k26-text)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-k26-ui)', fontSize: '40px', fontWeight: 600, letterSpacing: '-0.03em', lineHeight: '46px' }}>\n          Dialoger och överlägg\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-k26-secondary)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-k26-ui)', fontSize: '16px', lineHeight: '24px' }}>\n          Dialog bara för det som inte går att ångra eller lämnar systemet: utfärda, skicka, avbryta. Dialogen upprepar exakt vad som händer.\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style={{ backgroundColor: '#CDD2DA', borderRadius: '12px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', gap: '32px', padding: '48px' }}>\n        <div style={{ backgroundColor: 'var(--color-k26-surface)', borderRadius: '12px', boxShadow: '#0F172A14 0px 0px 0px 1px, #0F172A26 0px 12px 32px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', flexShrink: '0', width: '520px' }}>\n          <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: '6px', paddingInline: '24px', paddingTop: '24px' }}>\n            <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-k26-text)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-k26-ui)', fontSize: '16px', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: '22px' }}>\n              Utfärda faktura F-2026-0039?\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-k26-secondary)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-k26-ui)', fontSize: '13px', lineHeight: '20px' }}>\n              Fakturan låses och får nummer. Den kan bara ändras med en kreditfaktura.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div style={{ borderColor: 'var(--color-k26-rule)', borderRadius: '8px', borderStyle: 'solid', borderWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', marginBottom: '20px', marginLeft: '24px', marginRight: '24px', marginTop: '20px', paddingInline: '14px' }}>\n            <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', borderBottomColor: 'var(--color-k26-rule)', borderBottomStyle: 'solid', borderBottomWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexShrink: '0', height: '36px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>\n              <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-k26-caption)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-k26-ui)', fontSize: '13px', lineHeight: '16px' }}>\n                Kund\n              </div>\n              <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-k26-text)', fontFamily: 'var(--font-k26-ui)', fontSize: '13px', lineHeight: '16px' }}>\n                Björkdalen Skogsförvaltning AB\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div style={{ alignItems: 'center', borderBottomColor: 'var(--color-k26-rule)', borderBottomStyle: 'solid', borderBottomWidth: '1px', boxSizing: 'border-box', display: 'flex', flexShrink: '0', height: '36px', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>\n              <div style={{ boxSizing: 'border-box', color: 'var(--color-k26-caption)', fontFamily: '